{"parse": {"title": "TSOO-06", "pageid": 8695, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TSOO-05\" title=\"TSOO-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSOO-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSOO-07\" title=\"TSOO-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSOO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.BE.E8.A1.8C.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雾行者\">雾行者</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雾行者</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Fog Walker</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>步<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>浓<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挣<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>囚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>牢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我偏离了大路，误入了浓雾之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我哭泣着，但浓雾吞噬了我一切的求助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我唯一能够得到的感情，仅有恐惧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑雾笼罩着我，几乎要将我吞噬殆尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在我绝望到了极点的时候，一道伟岸的身影自浓雾的深处走了进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他撑着庞大的黑伞，顶着不合时宜的高顶礼帽，步伐稳重而从容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绝望的黑雾不甘地尖啸着，挣扎着，试图从他的身边逃离出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那只是徒劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人比他更加清楚应该如何对付这些令人绝望的黑雾。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他一步步朝着我走来，他的背后，是温暖而充满着希望的阳光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——穿透黑雾，照亮了我的阳光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那道伟岸的身影来到了我的身边，轻轻地将手搭在了我的肩膀上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“奥利弗，我们回家吧。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他轻声说道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在这一刻，我明白了雾行者的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所谓的雾行者，便是步入浓雾，为他人带来阳光的职业。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它本质上只是一份职业，就像是拧螺丝与挑粪一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但它也不仅如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲穿过迷雾，给我带来了希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那一天，他同样也是这么做的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这是我的责任，也是我们的责任。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>放在我肩上的手轻轻离开，他重新戴上了礼帽，步入了浓雾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那片将他吞噬殆尽的贪婪浓雾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像他自迷雾中寻找到我，给我带来希望一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1952年的那一天，他也为整个伦敦城更多的人，带去了希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>活下去的希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——忽然间，我开始痛哭。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_wuxingzheweixiukai2\"><img alt=\"at_wuxingzheweixiukai2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png/600px-Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png/900px-Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png/1200px-Cg-at_wuxingzheweixiukai2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>辛苦了，奥利弗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>奥利弗，我们回家吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>在未来的某一天，我也能够像你们以及……父亲一样，为他人带来希望吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人坚信，一定会有那么一天的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人说过了，您有成为骑士的潜质的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSOO-06"}}